---
import Storefront from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---
<Storefront title="Authenticity Guarantee">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase mb-8">The Authenticity Directive</h1>
    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert font-mono text-sm max-w-none text-content-muted">
      <p>Symeno operates on a zero-tolerance policy for counterfeit hardware.</p>
      <p>Every unit that passes through our arbitrage network is verified against OEM cryptographic supply chain signatures. Serial numbers are logged immutably prior to dispatch.</p>
      <p>If hardware is compromised, the transaction is reversed immediately at our expense.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Storefront>
